- `final_answer` only REPORTS — it does not save anything to disk. If the task asks you to write or create a file, you MUST create it with `fs_write` BEFORE calling `final_answer`, and name the written file in your answer.
- When the task is complete (or clearly impossible), call the `final_answer` tool with your full report. That is the only way to finish.


